    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Analyze the 25 sample reviews. Assign each review exactly one primary theme. Return no more than 5 theme objects in this format: {\"name\":\"theme name\",\"count\":integer}. The counts must add up to exactly 25. Set top_3_themes to the three highest-count theme objects, ranked by count.\n\nUse these verified exact review excerpts:\n- 9f5b56bf-43de-4e69-8b74-613b1fc79ba6 — \"lagging chart\"\n- d44fe8e4-fb0b-462e-8ebb-e3cde86f440f — \"app stuck problem 5min chart not working\"\n- 153c280d-8715-4aa0-8ceb-e3cde86f440f — \"borkar jada hai20 ki jagah 10\"\n\nThe weekly pulse must be 40 words or fewer. Keep the key observation to one short sentence and give exactly 3 brief action ideas. Do not repeat quotes or actions in the pulse.\n\nThe wider review scan found a recurring brokerage cost concern, not a confirmed misunderstanding:\n- 4caf3c83-d249-4289-9b9e-c50f576c5646\n- d8e90096-6679-4ab6-8570-5c8b4b43b01e\n\nGive at most 4 neutral fee explanation bullets, each 15 words or fewer. Facts: equity brokerage is the lower of ₹20 or 0.1% of trade value per executed order, with a ₹5 minimum; F&O brokerage is ₹20 per order; separate orders add up; other applicable charges may apply. Return only the two fee review IDs in fee_evidence.\n\nSet identified_fee_issue to \"Recurring brokerage cost concern; the reviews do not confirm a misunderstanding.\" Set last_checked to \"2026-11-10\".\n\nReturn compact, valid JSON only—no markdown fences—with these keys:\nthemes, top_3_themes, quotes, key_observation, action_ideas, weekly_pulse, identified_fee_issue, fee_evidence, explanation_bullets, source_links, last_checked\n\nUse these exact source links:\nhttps://groww.in/pricing\nhttps://groww.in/help/payments/payments-charges/why-is-my-brokerage-more-than-20-rupees--71\n\nSample reviews:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.reviews) }}",
        "batching": {}
      },
